      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 4.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "you're alright take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.61,
      "end_seconds": 16.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I've been dealing with fainting on exertion"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.85,
      "end_seconds": 20.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.71,
      "end_seconds": 24.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "probably about a week yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.84,
      "end_seconds": 30.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "yes, carry on okay, would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.27,
      "end_seconds": 33.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "mostly severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.08,
      "end_seconds": 36.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.6,
      "end_seconds": 51.06,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "Chest tightness goes along with it, uh, most of the time. With Chest tightness, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. It's a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.91,
      "end_seconds": 55.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.16,
      "end_seconds": 58.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No fever, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.66,
      "end_seconds": 61.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "any cough or leg pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.78,
      "end_seconds": 65.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "no none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.82,
      "end_seconds": 68.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.48,
      "end_seconds": 71.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.14,
      "end_seconds": 74.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.1,
      "end_seconds": 77.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.16,
      "end_seconds": 80.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.98,
      "end_seconds": 85.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.56,
      "end_seconds": 89.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.77,
      "end_seconds": 96.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.81,
      "end_seconds": 99.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.79,
      "end_seconds": 104.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.85,
      "end_seconds": 127.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.32,
      "end_seconds": 133.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Gout, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.38,
      "end_seconds": 136.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.74,
      "end_seconds": 139.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.64,
      "end_seconds": 149.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "right, so gout is already on your record we'll keep that in mind today have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.76,
      "end_seconds": 155.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I had two stents put in my heart three years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.46,
      "end_seconds": 169.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.1,
      "end_seconds": 173.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "my uncle has high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.79,
      "end_seconds": 179.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.5,
      "end_seconds": 187.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Allopurinol. I take it 100 milligrams, once a day for the gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.6,
      "end_seconds": 191.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.14,
      "end_seconds": 199.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Two months now it's clopidogrel 75 milligrams once a day for the stent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.84,
      "end_seconds": 214.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.37,
      "end_seconds": 218.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.06,
      "end_seconds": 222.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.3,
      "end_seconds": 235.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.61,
      "end_seconds": 257.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.4 degrees pulse is 93 beats a minute SpO2 93 percent on room air pressure 137 over 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.23,
      "end_seconds": 263.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.02,
      "end_seconds": 266.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.64,
      "end_seconds": 283.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "there is a loud second heart sound and a raised jugular pulse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.5,
      "end_seconds": 309.16,
      "duration_seconds": 21.66,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably possible pulmonary hypertension. A heart valve problem is still possible. We should do an echocardiogram for exertional syncope. No exertion for now, I am arranging urgent specialist tests."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.47,
      "end_seconds": 315.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Do I need blood tests? I read it might help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.17,
      "end_seconds": 324.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "I wouldn't order it today if anything changes we'll reconsider anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.6,
      "end_seconds": 329.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    }
  ]
}